CAESAR CHANGELOG (fork of Sharkord)
===================================

General
-------
- Whiteboards (adapted from BoardFlow), with arrows and snap-to-grid
- Markdown to HTML rendering using marked
- External link warning on outbound links
- Audio/video preview
- Syntax highlighted code blocks
- Nicknames (JSON, local only)
- YouTube shorts/lives/etc supported in previews
- Client-side embeds for links
- GIPHY support
- Search all messages (plus fixed search logic in DMs and global)
- Soundboard with volume controller
- Social credit: 1 per 15 min active, capped at 50/day
- Reset balances and fixed roulette odds
- DMs: direct reply, mentions fixes, 1:1 calls, no threads/upvotes, bulk delete conversation
- Files and chats in ephemeral DMs are E2EE encrypted
- DLTN noise suppression
- Optional birthday field with toast 24h before
- Voice indicator and sound/stream controls in left sidebar
- "Hide own stream" and "appear offline" options
- Removed auto-join last channel, new Notifications options
- Optional "Read at HH:MM" receipts via Notifications
- Keyboard (no mouse) friendly navigation
- Two streams split horizontal instead of vertical
- Mention channels using #
- Move members and categories/channels with drag and drop (overlay + preview)
- Image statuses (stories-like)
- Removed per-voice-channel chat (redundant)
- Removed hardcoded SharkordUser, identity used by default
- CAESAR_MAX_USERS=N cap
- Add manifest PWA for native Chrome installs + worker for push

UX/UI
-----
- Save/Cancel buttons at top of settings pages
- Fixed stream placeholder breaking flexbox layout when de-activating
- Fixed upvotes appearing twice for message groups
- Fixed stale custom emojis (now appended to recent and quick replies)
- Fixed cache ETag on images (stops re-downloading same assets)
- On 1:1 call: focus DM panel and top-bar voice controls
- Suppress signal when sender is offline
- Mobile/half-screen(< 1024px) layout fixes
- Fixed error codes
- Hooked transport stats to actually reflect issues
- Various layout/UX polish
- Respect system theme pref
- Set default enGB format HH:MM

Security
--------
- UUIDs and JWT tokens for /public/ path files (except server login image)
- Origin validated against Host header (replaced Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *)
- Security headers: X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy, HSTS, CSP
- Per-request CSP nonces for script-src, stricter CSP policies overall
- Password hash removed from getUserById/getUsers (kept only in getUserByIdentity)
- upload.ts enforces actual byte count
- Login sets HttpOnly SameSite=Strict cookie; public.ts reads header/cookie
- get-file-url.ts no longer leaks token in URL
- Invite-only model, no more custom codes
- Security tab: multiple sessions opt-in (default OFF), session kick-out list
- Fixed auto-login (multiple tabs) or single session enforced when off
- U2F key support
- Admins see hashed location/IPs only, never raw
- Per-role permissions for DMs, fixed text vs voice channel permissions
- Tightened user-select queries (data exposure minimization)
- Input validation fixes
- Rate limiting additions
- Various ACL fixes
- Fixed auth logout endpoint, proper unmount on log-out
- Properly close E2EE worker

Dev
---
- Full switch from bun to pnpm
- CI: knip added to git workflow
- Updated all deps, pinned major for TS/Node/mediasoup
- Removed logging deps and git integration
- Dockerfile, renovate conf, embed helper: no stale artifacts
- 570 relative import sites changed to @ patterns
- 73 imports moved from server to shared
- Removed shared/trpc.ts re-export and ws.WebSocket module augmentation
- prod-dev compose profile for fresh https testing on 8443
- Fixed seed (original spawning for server)
- PRAGMA modes for SQLite
- Removed plugin system
- Lazy load / chunked most things
- Cleanup after leaving channel or settings page
- Heap profiling
- Documentation work
- Manifest, version strings, github url updates
- Various upstream ports and duplicate-reducing refactors
